      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040160,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "とても素敵です\r\nこの辺りはかわいいお店がいっぱいあるんですよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "se": "0120",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040160"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "買い物にはよく来るんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040170,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ。お洋服を見たり、鳥さんの小物を見たり……\r\nいろいろなお店を、ゆっくり回るのが好きです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040170"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nじゃあ今日は、真乃の買い物に付き合うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040180,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "え、でも……\r\n私のお買い物は、とっても時間がかかっちゃいますよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040190,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから私、お買い物する時はいつもひとりなんです\r\n誰かと一緒だと、お待たせしちゃうのが気になって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040190"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんだ？\r\n最近はどうかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040200,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040200"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルになってから、仲間が増えただろ\r\n事務所のみんなと買い物に行ったりはしないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040210,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、そういえば……\r\n時々、めぐるちゃんに誘ってもらえるようになりました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040220,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "お待たせしてないか少し心配ですけど……\r\nとっても楽しいです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040220"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nめぐるもきっと、楽しいから真乃を誘うんだと思うな",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃と一緒にいられて、俺も楽しいよ\r\nだから、そんなに気を遣うことはないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040230,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが、そう言ってくれるなら……\r\n実は私……行きたいお店があるんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040230"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、これからそこへ行こうか",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004040240,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、よろしくお願いします",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100404/2001004040240"
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "デパートの屋上にしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
